    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31504" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nūtrīcātus</span></b> ,
			ūs, m.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				suckling, nursing</i> (ante-class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">plane eductus in nutricatu Venerio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Mil. 3, 1, 55</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pecoris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 2, 1, 20</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A nourishing, rearing</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">herba non evellenda in nutricatu,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 1, 47</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">1, 49</span></i>; <i><span class="en">3, 9</span></i>.</div>
